<title>USA: GenRad has deal to sell systems for $10 mln.</title>
<headline>GenRad has deal to sell systems for $10 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>GenRad Inc said Tuesday it has an agreement for Cabletron Systems Inc to buy about $10 million worth of GenRad systems over two years.</p>
<p>The company said the deal calls for Cabletron to buy GenRad's Geneva Functional Test and Measurement Systems for use in Cabletron manufacturing facilities.</p>
<p>The first order will be shipped in the third quarter, it said.</p>
</text>
